{"id":"d8ff8ac112a08548","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-group-extension.md","title":"Group Extension","display":"df-group-extension — Group Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-group-extension","aliases":["58-df-group-extension","Group Extension"],"display":"df-group-extension — Group Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-short-exact.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-group-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-group-extension</span><span>Group Extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-group-extension — Group Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10e6ac165c352cd8\" href=\"?note=10e6ac165c352cd8\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-short-exact.md\">../batch01/58-df-short-exact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md\">../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,G,Q,i,\\pi\\in V\">\\(N,G,Q,i,\\pi\\in V\\)</span> 为载体及映射候选。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q,s\">\\(\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q,s\\)</span> 为辅助变量；公共五参数谓词按下式投影结构数据。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S\\)</span> 为九参数辅助谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GroupExtension}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{GroupExtension}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SplitExtension}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SplitExtension}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CentralExtension}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CentralExtension}_S\\)</span> 为原有五参数谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,A,\\cdot_A,B,\\cdot_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,A,\\cdot_A,B,\\cdot_B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,A,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}_S(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}_S(f,A,B)\\)</span> 取依赖文件中的定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(i,N,\\cdot_N,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\pi,G,\\cdot_G,Q,\\cdot_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(i,N,G)\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}_S(\\pi,G,Q)\n\\land e_Q\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_Q(\\langle e_Q,q\\rangle)=q=\\cdot_Q(\\langle q,e_Q\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{i(n):n\\in N\\}=\\{g\\in G:\\pi(g)=e_Q\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(i,N,\\cdot_N,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\pi,G,\\cdot_G,Q,\\cdot_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(i,N,G)\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}_S(\\pi,G,Q)\n\\land e_Q\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_Q(\\langle e_Q,q\\rangle)=q=\\cdot_Q(\\langle q,e_Q\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{i(n):n\\in N\\}=\\{g\\in G:\\pi(g)=e_Q\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GroupExtension}_S(i,G,\\pi;N,Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GroupExtension}_S(i,G,\\pi;N,Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SplitExtension}_S(i,G,\\pi;N,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}\n\\exists\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(s,Q,\\cdot_Q,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\pi(s(q))=q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SplitExtension}_S(i,G,\\pi;N,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}\n\\exists\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(s,Q,\\cdot_Q,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\pi(s(q))=q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CentralExtension}_S(i,G,\\pi;N,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}\n\\exists\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\n\\cdot_G(\\langle i(n),g\\rangle)=\\cdot_G(\\langle g,i(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CentralExtension}_S(i,G,\\pi;N,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}\n\\exists\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S(i,G,\\pi,N,Q,\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\n\\cdot_G(\\langle i(n),g\\rangle)=\\cdot_G(\\langle g,i(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Group extension: exact sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1 \\to N \\to G \\to Q \\to 1\">\\(1 \\to N \\to G \\to Q \\to 1\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> built from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span></li>\n<li>Semidirect product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\cong N \\rtimes Q\">\\(G \\cong N \\rtimes Q\\)</span> when section exists; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> acts on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span></li>\n<li>For an abelian <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>-module <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> with a fixed action, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^2(Q,N)\">\\(H^2(Q,N)\\)</span> classifies equivalence classes of extensions inducing that action.</li>\n<li>The Schur multiplier is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_2(G,\\mathbb Z)\">\\(H_2(G,\\mathbb Z)\\)</span>; it is not the conjunction previously written with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^2(G,\\mathbb C^\\times)\">\\(H^2(G,\\mathbb C^\\times)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Robinson, A Course in the Theory of Groups</li>\n<li>Brown, Cohomology of Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-short-exact.md","status":"resolved","id":"10e6ac165c352cd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-short-exact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,G,Q,i,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_N,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_Q,e_Q,s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupExtensionData}_S","displa